  <Docs>
    <summary>Specifies how a <see cref="T:Android.Hardware.Input.UriCustomizationAction" /> opens its target URI.</summary>
    <remarks>
      <para>The action can open a file, open a directory in the system file browser, or open a web URL when a customized peripheral input is triggered.</para>
      <para>These values correspond to the <c>TYPE_OPEN_*</c> constants in the <format type="text/html"><a href="https://developer.android.com/reference/android/hardware/input/UriCustomizationAction">Android UriCustomizationAction reference</a></format>.</para>
    </remarks>
  </Docs>
